sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User
    participant Market as PredictionMarket
    participant Oracle as Public Metrics Oracle
    participant Apple as Apple Public Charts
    participant Resolver as PredictionOracle
    User->>Market: Buy simulated outcome position
    Market->>Market: Lock collateral
    Oracle->>Apple: Retrieve chart snapshot
    Apple-->>Oracle: Return public ranking data
    Oracle->>Oracle: Validate and preserve evidence
    Oracle->>Resolver: Submit attestation
    Resolver->>Resolver: Apply challenge / review rules
    Resolver->>Market: Finalize outcome
    User->>Market: Claim eligible payout
    Market-->>User: Release simulated winnings
